<title>USA: Illinois direct hogs $1.00-1.50 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>Illinois direct hogs $1.00-1.50 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $1.00-1.50 higher. Demand good. Top $60.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-2  230-260 lbs. 59.50-60.00, some 60.50, few 59.00</p>
<p>US 2-3  230-260 lbs. 58.50-59.50</p>
<p>Sows: 1.00 higher. Top 50.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-400 lbs. 43.00-46.00</p>
<p>	  400-500 lbs. 45.00-47.00</p>
<p>	  500-600 lbs. 47.00-49.00</p>
<p>few over  600 lbs. 48.00-50.00</p>
</text>
